1
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:03,940
Defense!

2
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:17,320
Shinjo suddenly changed up their defense!

3
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,580
Man-to-man, huh?

4
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:21,330
Hey, Nanao... I'm worried about one thing.

5
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,750
I hate to say it, but...

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,210
Not everyone on our team wins
when it comes down to individual skill.

7
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,920
You think it's gonna be easy
to take me one-on-one, then?

8
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:41,270
Captain...

9
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,680
Don't sweat it. He just took the bait.

10
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:45,980
Roku, let me fill you in.

11
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:50,900
He's driving to the basket!

12
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:01,830
There are no openings for 
me... to pass through!

13
00:01:01,830 --> 00:01:04,840
Have you noticed it, Tokiwa?

14
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,790
Of course.

15
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,500
By arranging their defense 
to focus on one side,

16
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,250
they cut the space the point 
guard can work with in half.

17
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:12,840
It's a fast break!

18
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:18,840
Stop right there, dammit!

19
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:22,260
No way I'm just gonna let you drop it in!

20
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:23,640
Hiyah!

21
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:40,740
However, we can still win this.

22
00:01:41,370 --> 00:01:44,750
Geniuses are actually... 
surprisingly fragile.

23
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,300
His pass timing is way off!

24
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,420
What's wrong with you, Chiaki?!

25
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,100
This is really throwing me off my game!

26
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:11,020
The worst part is that Chiaki has

27
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:13,320
been thrown off
both offensively and defensively,

28
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:15,440
which affects the rhythm of the entire team!

29
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:17,900
We need this basket... no matter what!

30
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:31,380
What's the deal, Chiaki? 
This ain't like you, man.

31
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:32,080
Huh?

32
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:35,590
Do you wanna go watch this game
from the bench, or what?!

33
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,130
Easy for you to say, pea-brain.

34
00:03:08,370 --> 00:03:11,080
Ahiru no Sora

35
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,810
Shinjotowa / Kuzuryu

36
00:04:16,150 --> 00:04:17,900
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

37
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,400
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

38
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,780
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

39
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:22,070
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

40
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,780
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

41
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,490
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

42
00:04:25,490 --> 00:04:26,740
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

43
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:28,240
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

44
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,580
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

45
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:31,200
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

46
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,670
Whoa, look at that #4 go!

47
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:38,630
Wait, damn you!

48
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:44,510
Pushing! White #7!

49
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:49,470
I hadn't even actually pushed yet!

50
00:04:49,810 --> 00:04:52,930
Come on, Chiaki! That's your second foul,
please be more careful!

51
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,400
Don't bother chasing him. 
You're not quick enough.

52
00:04:56,940 --> 00:05:00,360
We'll jump in to help,
so have some more faith in your backup.

53
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,740
He drove it in!

54
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,120
Awesome moves, Tamo!

55
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,580
Kuzuryu

56
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:10,580
They're catching up! Only 4 points now!

57
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:13,700
They managed to hold on to the lead
for the first quarter...

58
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:16,000
...but they're still slowly being cornered.

59
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:19,290
That's 'cuz Shinjo is totally controlling
the pace of this game.

60
00:05:20,210 --> 00:05:23,010
It's only a matter of 
time until they catch up.

61
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:25,260
Let's score some points this time!

62
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:28,340
Wow, Kuzu High really knows how to hustle!

63
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,930
They're just as fast as Shinjo!

64
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:35,980
No, not quite.

65
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:37,690
Shinjo made it back quicker!

66
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:43,690
So low!

67
00:05:45,490 --> 00:05:47,240
He's taking their center head on!

68
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,110
But that height gap is ridiculous!

69
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:54,240
No way... he's taking a shot?!

70
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,580
I got this!

71
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:04,380
Counter!

72
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,630
Crap!

73
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:13,970
Shinjotowa

74
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,390
He nailed it!

75
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:13,970
Now we're just one basket away!

76
00:06:14,810 --> 00:06:15,930
Nice, Captain!

77
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:18,890
Shinjotowa has a really solid team.

78
00:06:18,890 --> 00:06:26,620
Defense! Defense! Defense! Defense!

79
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:26,530
I thought their main offensive strategy
would be to play in the paint...

80
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:29,110
...but so far it's been 
mostly just run and gun.

81
00:06:29,740 --> 00:06:32,870
With all of their plays coming at us so fast,
there's no time to consider defense,

82
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:35,580
since everyone is just focused
on getting back up the floor.

83
00:06:36,290 --> 00:06:40,000
All the stamina that we lose now,
is going to hurt us badly in the endgame.

84
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,250
Traveling!

85
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:44,880
Huh?!

86
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,880
Damn!

87
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,840
Yasu!

88
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:49,170
Just piss off. Piece of shit.

89
00:06:52,890 --> 00:06:55,850
Kuzuryu

90
00:06:53,550 --> 00:06:55,060
Only down by 2 now.

91
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:57,730
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

92
00:06:57,730 --> 00:06:59,230
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

93
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:00,770
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

94
00:07:00,770 --> 00:07:02,350
Crush 'em, crush 'em! Shinjo!

95
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:03,860
One more basket! Let's play it safe!

96
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:03,860
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

97
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:05,150
Let's go, let's go! Shinjo!

98
00:07:05,150 --> 00:07:06,280
They're slowing down.

99
00:07:07,030 --> 00:07:07,690
Finally...

100
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,900
Guess this means they want to
tie it up here no matter what.

101
00:07:11,410 --> 00:07:12,910
Takahashi...

102
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:21,120
It's not gonna happen. I'm 
not gonna let you do it!

103
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,960
A three-pointer!

104
00:07:34,470 --> 00:07:35,800
It went in!

105
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:40,230
Shinjotowa

106
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:38,890
It's a comeback!

107
00:07:38,890 --> 00:07:40,230
And they made it look so easy, too!

108
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:42,190
Sly dog.

109
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,440
How was that "playing it safe"?

110
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:48,150
It's just another one of 
Takahashi's signature moves.

111
00:07:48,150 --> 00:07:51,150
He's always been good at faking people out
for as long as I can remember.

112
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:54,280
Let's go! Let's go! Takahashi! 
You rock! You rock! Takahashi!

113
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,370
Incredible...

114
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:01,080
An all-rounder that's 190 centimeters tall.

115
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,290
This guy is literally the 
ideal basketball player.

116
00:08:04,290 --> 00:08:05,540
Defense!

117
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:09,090
I want to get out there... 
and play against him.

118
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,670
We're taking the lead back!

119
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:18,760
Whoa! They're not backing down!

120
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,640
They're charging at them like bulls!

121
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:36,030
Don't let him past you, Yukio!

122
00:08:39,330 --> 00:08:40,290
What the-?!

123
00:08:40,290 --> 00:08:41,750
Did you just see that?!

124
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:46,170
How does that #11 do it?!
All his moves seem superhuman!

125
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:56,590
Shit! This guy jumps a lot 
higher than his looks lead on.

126
00:08:57,470 --> 00:08:58,890
It got blocked!

127
00:09:00,850 --> 00:09:02,310
Sweet! We got the ball!

128
00:09:02,930 --> 00:09:03,520
Hey, Chiaki!

129
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,730
A pass?!

130
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:05,980
No!

131
00:09:06,650 --> 00:09:08,440
He's going straight for it!

132
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:19,330
Charging! White #7!

133
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,080
That's his third...

134
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:30,540
It's still only the first half,
but their playmaker is having foul trouble!

135
00:09:35,470 --> 00:09:37,220
Timeout! White team!

136
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:38,640
Hey.

137
00:09:40,050 --> 00:09:41,560
You sly dog.

138
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:45,560
Hell yeah!

139
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:06,790
Everything is in Shinjo's favor now.

140
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:09,040
You were amazing out there, Takahashi!

141
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,630
We can totally win this!

142
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:13,300
They're getting too damn 
smug over taking the lead.

143
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:15,550
It's still just a one point difference!

144
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:18,800
That's not what's hurting us.

145
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,220
Huh?

146
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:23,310
The real issue is... the fact 
that Chiaki has three fouls.

147
00:10:23,310 --> 00:10:25,180
Especially so early into the game.

148
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:28,890
I thought it took 5 fouls to get ejected.
That means he's still got two left!

149
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:30,600
You're looking at it the wrong way.

150
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,060
He's ONLY got two left.

151
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:35,890
Just think about what happens
if he gets one more foul after this.

152
00:10:35,890 --> 00:10:39,660
He'll end up playing conservatively
simply due to the high risk of ejection.

153
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:44,080
So really, it's your fourth 
foul that knocks you out.

154
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:48,540
Normally, this is where we'd just pull him out
and save him for the second half.

155
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,080
But we might end up screwing ourselves over

156
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,080
with only one point guard out on the court.

157
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,590
Not to mention we'd be losing 
one of our taller players.

158
00:10:55,590 --> 00:10:57,700
Even if we did let the shrimp 
take over in his place,

159
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:59,880
a zone defense would give us major trouble.

160
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:02,800
I guess it's still too much for 
Sora to handle right now...

161
00:11:04,050 --> 00:11:07,810
It's risky as hell,
but we're just gonna have to keep Chiaki in.

162
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:13,060
They've really brought him to his knees...
I've never seen Chiaki like this before.

163
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,150
Come on!

164
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:18,150
It's time to launch our rescue operation
to save that poor bra!

165
00:11:18,230 --> 00:11:20,360
Great. Then I shall take the first peek!

166
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:25,330
The Chiaki that I know
is always brimming with confidence.

167
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:28,910
Dude, we've been through so much.
You could've picked better scenes.

168
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:30,620
Let's stay calm for now.

169
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,710
Like Nabe said earlier, Chiaki has

170
00:11:32,710 --> 00:11:36,090
two fouls left before he actually 
gets ejected from the game.

171
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,300
We're not at an impasse just yet.

172
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,720
Hey, man, what's an "impasse"?

173
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:45,510
It's like a "dead end." She 
means we still have a chance.

174
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:49,020
That being said, I want to avoid having
one of our main players foul out.

175
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:52,690
So I'm going to bench
both Chiaki and Yasuhara for the time being.

176
00:11:52,690 --> 00:11:53,730
Me, too?

177
00:11:54,060 --> 00:11:55,810
Kurumatani will be point guard.

178
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,880
I want Chucky to go out 
as our shooting guard and

179
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:02,020
focus on providing support for Kurumatani.

180
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:02,700
S-sure.

181
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:04,160
And then...

182
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:06,280
Shigeyoshi will play center.

183
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:09,330
Making Momoharu our power forward.

184
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:12,540
You're in charge of the inside
for both offense and defense.

185
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:16,080
Natsume, in addition to your 
usual dribble penetration

186
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:17,830
I want you to start shooting from long-range.

187
00:12:17,830 --> 00:12:19,090
Ideally, I want you to draw

188
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:21,760
enough attention
to get our opponents to double team you.

189
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:26,100
Even if you miss, you can trust the guys
under the basket to back you up, right?

190
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,220
Well... yeah.

191
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:32,890
What kinda look is that?

192
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:35,060
As for you, Kurumatani...

193
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,360
Listen close.

194
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:39,940
If benching Chiaki is enough
to let our opponents run away with the game,

195
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:42,860
then this team has no future 
no matter what we do.

196
00:12:44,570 --> 00:12:47,280
Can you fill the hole that 
Chiaki is leaving behind?

197
00:12:57,710 --> 00:12:59,170
Without a doubt.

198
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,130
Let's do this!

199
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:04,880
Shinjo ball!

200
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:12,310
Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo! 
Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo!

201
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,310
I lied.

202
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:15,410
It already seems hopeless 
without Chiaki and I

203
00:13:15,410 --> 00:13:18,270
didn't want to give them 
any more reasons to worry.

204
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:21,980
The truth is that I'm full 
of nothing but doubts.

205
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:25,200
But even so, I've gotta do this!

206
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:31,200
I've gotta become a player like Chiaki...
one who everyone can rely on!

207
00:13:32,950 --> 00:13:35,080
Looks like Kuzu High 
changed up their defense.

208
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,540
A 3-2 zone, eh?

209
00:13:37,290 --> 00:13:39,490
Dude, that #12 is downright huge!

210
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:42,000
He's got to be taller than 
even Shinjo's #8, for sure!

211
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,260
So that's how they're playing it.

212
00:13:47,340 --> 00:13:48,640
Roku, switch with me.

213
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,300
Huh?

214
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:52,640
So, #4 moved to the low post.

215
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:54,850
Is he planning to take on the big guy?

216
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,320
Shit! They passed it above him so easily!

217
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:06,630
Those overhead passes are 
just gonna keep coming

218
00:14:06,630 --> 00:14:08,820
so long as that shorty 
is playing point guard.

219
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:11,240
It's all gonna come down
to their strength under the basket.

220
00:14:11,530 --> 00:14:14,700
He's forcing his way in.
He'll get fouled for charging like that!

221
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,620
Okay!

222
00:14:21,130 --> 00:14:21,540
So slick!

223
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,220
You saw me coming, huh?

224
00:14:34,930 --> 00:14:36,640
The streak continues!

225
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:39,440
I guess just adding in that 
super tall dude wasn't enough!

226
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:44,020
Yeah, I get it! It's MY fault 
for letting him get past me!

227
00:14:44,020 --> 00:14:46,490
Jeez, I didn't realize you 
could be such a jackass!

228
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:47,900
Dammit!

229
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,950
Everyone on the team... 
knows how you must feel.

230
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:54,100
So I think...

231
00:14:54,100 --> 00:14:59,160
...that's exactly why Nanao decided
to ask you that question... in front of all of us.

232
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:02,710
And in that moment, you answered clearly.

233
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:06,460
It psyched me up. Seeing your bravery.

234
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:08,670
Mokichi...

235
00:15:13,010 --> 00:15:14,260
Let's do our best.

236
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,720
Y-yeah.

237
00:15:17,430 --> 00:15:19,310
Let's do it! This one's going in the basket!

238
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,980
Don't react! Stay in position!

239
00:15:24,940 --> 00:15:26,650
Shinjo switched to zone, too!

240
00:15:26,650 --> 00:15:27,900
It's a showdown in the paint!

241
00:15:28,610 --> 00:15:32,030
With Chiaki on the bench,
we can't afford to let them pull way ahead!

242
00:15:34,780 --> 00:15:38,120
Kuzu High's big guy has to be
around 2 meters tall at least.

243
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:41,290
Seems like Shinjo has slightly 
more skill overall, though.

244
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:44,340
Yo, check that out.

245
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:45,000
Huh?

246
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:47,120
Those are players from Saijo.

247
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,710
But their team doesn't play today...

248
00:15:55,430 --> 00:15:58,770
Hey, Chucky! Make sure you take up
a defensive safety position!

249
00:15:58,770 --> 00:16:01,350
If there's a pass, don't 
just stay where you are!

250
00:16:01,730 --> 00:16:04,560
Please remember all of the things
that we worked on in practice!

251
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:08,030
Kurumatani! Keep your eyes on the shot clock!

252
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:10,360
I can't just repeatedly try 
to shoot a bunch of threes.

253
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,910
I'm not doing my job unless we score
by breaking their zone-D apart.

254
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,240
But time is running short...

255
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,450
Stay calm. Stay calm.

256
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:23,040
Defense! Defense! Defense! Defense!

257
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:25,080
This one... he's up to something!

258
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:29,050
He definitely doesn't look like the type
to try to bulldoze his way through, but...

259
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,800
...he's positioned himself 
way too far from the basket!

260
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:34,890
What the hell is he thinking?

261
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:41,390
Once they move in closer to the basket,
that guy seems even more like a giant!

262
00:16:41,730 --> 00:16:44,980
His reach is insane!
He's gotta be more than 2 meters tall!

263
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,440
So tall!

264
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:48,650
Nobody stands out more than him!

265
00:16:48,650 --> 00:16:51,240
What a relief! I'm glad 
Mokichi is on our side!

266
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,420
Now #11 is making his way in!

267
00:16:55,420 --> 00:16:56,570
They've got a chance!

268
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:01,540
Slowpoke! Hurry and throw it at me!

269
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:12,380
It's a hook!

270
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:13,220
From way high!

271
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:27,230
I can't believe he stopped 
a shot from that high!

272
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,110
All right! I got the ball!

273
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:32,280
Huh?!

274
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:34,070
Out of bounds! Shinjo ball!

275
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:38,280
Holy cow, #4 is awesome!
I've never seen anybody get that much air!

276
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:40,030
No way...

277
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:43,250
Even though Mokichi is more than 5 cm taller,
he still got blocked...

278
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:47,710
What's up?

279
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:48,920
They're discussing something.

280
00:17:51,050 --> 00:17:54,340
Before the out of bounds call,
there was a different violation from Shinjo.

281
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:55,880
As a result, Kuzuryu will receive 2 points.

282
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,840
What?! Why?!

283
00:17:58,340 --> 00:18:00,390
Must have been goaltending.

284
00:18:00,390 --> 00:18:02,810
Seriously? In a high school game like this?

285
00:18:02,810 --> 00:18:04,480
Goal what now?

286
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,520
What'd they say?

287
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,520
"Goaltending."

288
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:11,320
After the ball is shot and 
starts falling from its apex,

289
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:13,560
nobody can touch it until it hits the rim.

290
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:17,580
The shot that Shigeyoshi just made
started with the ball well above the rim.

291
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:21,490
In other words, it began falling
from its apex the moment he let go.

292
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:25,870
So, if I get this right,
you're saying that he was shooting downwards?

293
00:18:25,870 --> 00:18:27,460
That's pretty much the gist of it.

294
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:31,920
As far as the rules are concerned,
the hook shot that he makes is impossible to block.

295
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:34,840
You can consider that a warning.

296
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:39,550
My hook isn't something... that you can stop.

297
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:45,720
That punk... He intentionally provoked me
to make sure I went for the block.

298
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:51,440
He's one crafty fox.
Way more vicious than he looks on the outside.

299
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:54,270
Actually get the ball in before 
you start talkin' shit.

300
00:18:54,690 --> 00:18:55,860
That's our Mokichi!

301
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,700
Get past this!

302
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:10,830
Shinjotowa

303
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:15,300
Defense! Defense! Defense! Defense!

304
00:19:11,210 --> 00:19:14,250
It's okay. Don't sweat it, Chucky!
Let's score one of our own!

305
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:15,300
Sure thing!

306
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,380
I can't waste the momentum
that Mokichi helped us start building.

307
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:21,720
I gotta score. I gotta score!

308
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:24,050
Kurumatani...

309
00:19:26,930 --> 00:19:34,320
Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo! Shi-n-jo!

310
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:35,730
This ain't good! Can that shorty 
really hold it together?

311
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:37,780
He looks like he's starting to choke!

312
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,990
White team ball! Throw in!

313
00:19:43,450 --> 00:19:45,160
Don't get so freaked out.

314
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:46,910
It'll be okay.

315
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:51,170
All you have to do... is focus on scoring.

316
00:19:52,210 --> 00:19:55,040
You're not fighting out here all by yourself.

317
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:59,970
You've got it wrong,
passing and shooting aren't important.

318
00:19:59,970 --> 00:20:01,590
Scoring points is.

319
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:05,050
You couldn't score enough points by the end,
and that's why you lost.

320
00:20:05,050 --> 00:20:05,800
Fool.

321
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:13,560
Whether it's man-to-man or zone.
The basics don't change.

322
00:20:17,190 --> 00:20:18,400
Right.

323
00:20:19,490 --> 00:20:20,690
Thank you.

324
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:25,410
I'm gonna break apart their 
zone with some passes!

325
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:27,280
Let's make sure we fill 
up any gaps they leave!

326
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:29,260
Get your hands up real high!

327
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:30,750
Watch out for passes that come in low!

328
00:20:31,410 --> 00:20:32,710
Let's make this one count!

329
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:36,420
A hook shot is totally worthless
unless you're close enough to the basket.

330
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:39,380
And I'm definitely not letting you
shoot anything from that area!

331
00:20:45,470 --> 00:20:46,760
A three pointer?!

332
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,310
Just like Takahashi did earlier!

333
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,270
That damn shrimp!

334
00:20:51,390 --> 00:20:52,730
He missed!

335
00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:55,480
Very close.

336
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:57,650
Great! We'll rebou-

337
00:21:01,030 --> 00:21:01,740
He knew!

338
00:21:02,570 --> 00:21:04,700
He expected #15 to shoot from long-range!

339
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,330
Chucky!

340
00:21:13,870 --> 00:21:14,460
He's wide open!

341
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:17,540
Th... This is my first shot!

342
00:21:26,010 --> 00:21:27,430
Nope! Can't do it!

343
00:21:28,970 --> 00:21:29,810
Nice fake!

344
00:21:29,810 --> 00:21:30,600
Yeah right...

345
00:21:32,220 --> 00:21:33,770
There's only one defender in front of him!

346
00:21:33,770 --> 00:21:35,020
But he's at a height disadvantage!

347
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:38,270
He stopped?! For a jumper?!

348
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:42,110
He went backwards at that speed?!

349
00:21:42,110 --> 00:21:43,440
A fadeaway!

350
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:47,870
Shinjotowa

351
00:21:45,280 --> 00:21:47,280
They followed through! It's down to 1 point!

352
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,330
You've gotten pretty damn good, Chucky!

353
00:21:50,330 --> 00:21:51,330
You better believe it!

354
00:21:51,330 --> 00:21:54,290
Yeah! All right!
That's the way!
That was a nice really move, Chucky!

355
00:21:54,290 --> 00:21:56,750
That's right! I'm not alone!

356
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,210
I've got a whole team!

357
00:23:30,970 --> 00:23:35,390
Ahiru no Sora
Next Time: Vow

358
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:34,010
Next time: "Vow."

